  "summary": {
    "text": "DeepSeek-V3.2 is a text-only language model in DeepSeek's V line with thinking and non-thinking modes, released on 1 December 2025 in the app, web chat and API, with open weights under the MIT License. DeepSeek calls it the official successor to DeepSeek-V3.2-Exp and its first model to integrate thinking directly into tool use.",
