  "notes": "Announced together with DeepSeek-V3.2-Speciale. The model card says it uses exactly the same architecture as DeepSeek-V3.2-Exp, and the technical report says it was created by continued pre-training from a DeepSeek-V3.1-Terminus base checkpoint followed by post-training; its Hugging Face card names DeepSeek-V3.2-Exp-Base as base model. Only the successor-of link to V3.2-Exp is recorded. No replacedBy: after 2026-04-24 the legacy API names were only routed to deepseek-v4-flash, and DeepSeek does not name a successor model for V3.2. The technical report appeared on arXiv on 2025-12-02, one day after the release."
